    "blurb": "AI-powered analysis of suspicious emails",
    "overview": "Employees forward suspicious emails and receive an AI-generated Guardian Report with a clear verdict. Camunda orchestrates privacy-safe threat analysis with Amazon Bedrock.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Stop phishing before users click",
    "splashDescription": "Phishing, CEO fraud, and malicious attachments regularly slip past spam filters, leaving employees to decide on their own whether a message is safe. This blueprint turns that uncertainty into a fast, structured answer. Employees simply forward a suspicious email. Camunda picks it up, retrieves headers and metadata via Microsoft Graph, and detects and masks personal data such as names before any AI processing takes place. An LLM-based threat assessment on Amazon Bedrock then classifies the email (for example, phishing, social engineering or CEO fraud, malware, scams, ransomware, spam, and suspicious links or attachments) and rates severity and confidence. The result is a Guardian Report, an HTML email sent back to the user with a clear verdict and concrete recommended actions. Privacy by design, a single EU-hosted data processor, and full process transparency make the solution suitable for organizations with strict compliance requirements.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/872565/overview/img6378792242301868339.png?ddbac138cc290d672f18353416a3243a",
